<title>USA: Gantos June net sales $14.1 mln, down.</title>
<headline>Gantos June net sales $14.1 mln, down.</headline>
<dateline>STAMFORD, Conn. 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gantos Inc said Thursday net sales for the five-week period ended July 5, 1997 fell 11 percent from the same period a year ago to $14.1 million.</p>
<p>Same-store sales, or net sales at stores open throughout both periods, also fell 12 percent, it said.</p>
<p>For the 22 weeks ended July 5, 1997, net sales were $72.5 million, off 10 percent from the same period a year ago. Same-store sales fell 11 percent.</p>
</text>
